  C1 --> CFR001 : View dashboard with financial data and insights.
  C1 --> CFR002 : Receive alerts on anomalous transactions via preferred channel.
  C1 --> CFR003 : Access predictive models based on historical data and market trends.
  C1 --> CFR004 : Get personalized investment recommendations tailored to goals.
  C1 --> CFR005 : Adjust preferences for personalization in recommendations.
  C1 --> CFR006 : Monitor spending limits through alerts when thresholds are breached.
  C1 --> CFR007 : Explore investment opportunities matching risk profile and ESG criteria.
  C1 --> CFR008 : Stay informed about market news relevant to portfolio holdings.
  C1 --> CFR009 : Access a consolidated view of all financial information for efficiency.
  C1 --> CFR010 : Manage data sharing permissions with advisors.

  F2 --> FAFR001 : Schedule and manage client mentoring sessions using system-generated insights.
  F2 --> FAFR002 : Review intervention alerts to proactively address clients' needs.
  F2 --> FAFR003 : Utilize predictive analytics for data-driven advisory services.

  S3 --> SAFR001 : Adjust AI parameters ensuring compliance with regulations like Basel III and FATF standards.

  Sys -- (SFR001) : Deliver alerts via appropriate channels.
  Sys -- (SFR002) : Provide personalized recommendations based on user profiles.
  Sys -- (SFR003) : Request financial predictions from AI for dashboard updates.
  Sys -- (SFR004) : Request specific recommendations aligned with user goals and preferences.
  Sys -- (SFR005) : Trigger spending limit alerts when thresholds are exceeded.
  Sys -- (SFR006) : Analyze investment opportunities based on risk profiles.
  Sys -- (SFR007) : Identify tailored investments that match criteria and ESG standards.
  Sys -- (SFR008) : Monitor for potential fraud by detecting anomalies in transactions.
  Sys -- (SFR009) : Extract relevant financial news to contextualize portfolio impacts.
  Sys -- (SFR010) : Generate client-specific dashboards with consolidated data.
  Sys -- (SFR012) : Request predictive intervention analyses for advisor guidance.
  Sys -- (AIFR003) : Detect unusual spending patterns and generate alerts.

  AIFR001 --> SFR003 : Provide financial predictions as input to the system.
  AIFR002 --> SFR004 : Offer personalized recommendations directly to clients through the system.
  AIFR006 --> SFR008 : Generate anomaly transaction alerts for compliance purposes.

' Client, Financial Advisor, and System Administrator are distinct roles interacting with various use cases. The System component includes all sub-systems (SFR*, AIFR*) which collaborate to deliver services to clients through the UI.
